      "flavour": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "| Kernel Concept | Spectre Adapter Mapping |\n|---|---|\n| Container | Spectre session/workflow grouping, with app state kept in Spectre tables |\n| App session identity | Spectre session id, slug, and session directory |\n| Phase label | "
